              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi kubg’ ubukuru yamuhaye, amoko yose n’amahanga n’abavuga indimi zitari zimwe bāhindira agashitsi imbere yiwe, bakamutinya; yica uwo agomvye kwica, agakiza uwo agomvye gukiza; yashira hejuru uwo agomvye, agacisha bugufi uwo agomvye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
