              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko yirukanwa mu bantu, umutima wiwe uhindurwa nk’uw’ ibikōko, aba hamwe n’indogoba z’inyeshamba, arisha nk’inka, kand’ umubiri wiwe utondwako n’urume ruva mu kirēre; gushitsa aho yamenyeye kw Īsumba vyose ari yo iganza ubgami bg’abantu, ikabgimikamw’ uwo igomba wese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
