        {
          "text": "ariko winantaje ku Mwami Nyen’ ijuru, uzanirwa ibintu vyo mu ngoro yiwe, kugira ngo wewe n’abaganwa bawe n’ abamikazi bawe n’incoreke zawe z’intoni mubinyweremw’ ibiturire; maz’ uhimbaza imana z’ ifeza n’iz’ izahabu n’iz’ imiringa n’iz’ ivyuma n’iz’ ibiti n’iz’ amabuye, zidashobora kubona canke kwumva canke kumenya; arikw Imana Rurema ifise impwemu zawe mu kuboko kwayo, ari yo igaba inzira zawe zose, ntiwayihaye icubahiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
